# Astrophage Game — Cursor Rules

## FIRST ACTION (mandatory before any code)
Read this file completely: .claude/skills/phaser4-gamedev/SKILL.md
Then read: assets/index.json
Do both before writing a single line of game code.

## Engine & Stack
- Phaser 3.87 ONLY — CDN: https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/phaser/3.87.0/phaser.min.js
- Reason: Phaser 4 is beta and unstable. Use Phaser 3.
- Vanilla JavaScript — NO TypeScript, NO React, NO Vue, NO build tools
- All scenes loaded via classic <script> tags in index.html
- NO import maps, NO ES modules, NO npm

## Project Paths
- Root: E:\VVVGame\
- Assets: E:\VVVGame\assets\ (see assets/index.json for full map)
- Scenes: E:\VVVGame\js\ (one file per scene)
- Entry: E:\VVVGame\index.html

## GLB Files Are 3D — Phaser Cannot Load Them
- musclecar.glb → use Rectangle(0,0,48,90) colored #444, label "CAR"
- spaceship.glb → use Rectangle(0,0,50,80) colored #336699, label "SHIP"
- alien_spaceship_with_fusion_core.glb → Rectangle colored #336633, label "ROCKY"
- rocket3.glb → Rectangle(0,0,40,100) colored #aaaaaa, label "MARY"
- girl-pixel.glb → Rectangle(0,0,32,64) colored #ffffff, label "EVA"
- When real PNG sprites are available, swap the rectangle — never refactor architecture

## Exhaust VFX
- Use Phaser particle emitter — do NOT load the PNG sheets as spritesheets yet
- Particle config: orange/grey circles, lifespan 400ms, speed 80, scale 0.3→0
- Attach emitter below car/ship, offset y +45

## Audio
- Use Howler.js for audio (already in index.html)
- MP3 path pattern: assets/spaceship_sounds/spaceship/mp3/
- Available categories: engine, explosion, laser, utility
- Always check AG.settings.audio before playing — Howler.mute(!AG.settings.audio)

## Shared State — window.AG (globals.js)
- NEVER create new global variables — use window.AG only
- NEVER use localStorage for mid-game state
- Pass data between scenes via this.scene.start('SceneName', { data })

## Scene Build Order — ONE SCENE PER CURSOR SESSION
1. SceneGym ← build and test this FIRST, nothing else
2. SceneMenu
3. SceneCinematic
4. ScenePhase1 (movement + road only first, no obstacles)
5. ScenePhase1 (add obstacles)
6. ScenePhase1 (add humans + camera pan)
7. SceneConversation
8. ScenePhase2 (solo ship + small enemies)
9. ScenePhase2 (Rocky arrival + 2P mode + boss)
10. ScenePhase3
11. SceneGameOver

## Always Use Delta for Movement
- CORRECT: this.player.x += this.speed * (delta / 1000)
- WRONG: this.player.x += this.speed

## HUD System
- Use a parallel Phaser Scene for HUD (key: 'SceneHUD')
- Launch it alongside gameplay: this.scene.launch('SceneHUD')
- Never put HUD elements inside gameplay scenes

## Physics
- Use arcade physics for all moving objects
- Enable: physics: { default: 'arcade', arcade: { gravity: { y:0 }, debug: false }}
- Use this.physics.add.overlap() for damage detection (not collider)
- Use object pools (Phaser Groups) for bullets and obstacles — never create/destroy each frame

## DO NOT
- Build more than 1 scene per session
- Use Three.js (it caused the previous broken build)
- Use position:fixed in any HTML overlay
- Hardcode asset paths — always reference assets/index.json
- Use frameWidth/frameHeight for the GLB files (they are not spritesheets)